  "metadata": {
    "name": "Ticket to Ride: Europe - Design Tokens & Color Palette",
    "version": "2.0.0",
    "source": "Original token values tuned to evoke the printed Days of Wonder components; not an official asset.",
    "description": "Colour system for train cards, route tracks, player pieces, board terrain and UI. Keys of cardColors match the lowercase route colours in data/routes.json.",
    "colorKeyMapping": "data/routes.json color (Title case) -> cardColors key (lowercase) -> engine TrainCardColor / RouteColor (UPPERCASE). The purple card is printed pink-violet; it is always called \"purple\" in code."
  },
